    "detailed_description": "Card RPG is a story driven turn based card game. Collect cards, craft equipment, increase your attributes, complete quests and earn money in your quest to save the orphanage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn orphan saved and raised by Clover Field Orphanage reaches maturity and yearns to follow their late parents into the adventurer profession.<br />\r\nHowever just as the orphan makes their first steps in the adventurer profession, the crumbling finances of the orphanage becomes apparent when the bank gave a final warning before foreclosing on the orphanage.<br />\r\nAnd so our orphan took on the debt and now must grow and develop to pay off the debt. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n70 collectable cards <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGrow the power of your cards.<br />\r\n\t- Cards scale with Strength, Agility, Constitution, Intelligence and Wisdom.<br />\r\n\t- Craft powerful items.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake quests and hunt powerful creatures.<br />\r\nTravel to many varied places in search of prey, wealth and glory.",
